+# CONTRACT — Permission Maze Document Management API
+
+`createApp()` exported from `src/app.ts` returns an Express app. In-memory storage.
+
+## Auth
+- [ ] POST /auth/register {username,password} -> 201 {id,username} (no password leaked)
+- [ ] register duplicate username -> 409
+- [ ] register missing username/password -> 400
+- [ ] POST /auth/login {username,password} -> 200 {token, user}
+- [ ] login wrong password -> 401
+- [ ] login unknown user -> 401
+- [ ] login missing fields -> 400
+- [ ] protected route without token -> 401
+- [ ] protected route with malformed/invalid token -> 401
+
+## Folders
+- [ ] POST /folders {name} -> 201, creator is owner
+- [ ] POST /folders {name,parentId} nested -> 201
+- [ ] POST /folders missing name -> 400
+- [ ] POST /folders with non-existent parentId -> 404
+- [ ] POST /folders with parent you lack editor on -> 403
+- [ ] GET /folders/:id as owner -> 200
+- [ ] GET /folders/:id not found -> 404
+- [ ] GET /folders/:id without access -> 403
+- [ ] PUT /folders/:id (rename) as owner/editor -> 200
+- [ ] PUT /folders/:id as viewer -> 403
+- [ ] DELETE /folders/:id as owner -> 204
+- [ ] DELETE /folders/:id as editor -> 403
+- [ ] DELETE folder cascades: child folders + documents removed
+
+## Documents
+- [ ] POST /documents {title,content,folderId} -> 201, creator is owner, logged
+- [ ] POST /documents missing title/folderId -> 400
+- [ ] POST /documents non-existent folder -> 404
+- [ ] POST /documents into folder without editor access -> 403
+- [ ] GET /documents/:id with viewer -> 200
+- [ ] GET /documents/:id not found -> 404
+- [ ] GET /documents/:id without access -> 403
+- [ ] PUT /documents/:id with editor -> 200, logged
+- [ ] PUT /documents/:id with viewer -> 403
+- [ ] DELETE /documents/:id with owner -> 204, logged
+- [ ] DELETE /documents/:id with editor -> 403
+
+## Sharing & Permissions
+- [ ] POST /folders/:id/share {username,role} by owner -> 201, logged
+- [ ] POST /documents/:id/share {username,role} by owner -> 201
+- [ ] share by editor (granting viewer/editor) -> 201
+- [ ] share with role=owner by non-owner editor -> 403
+- [ ] share by viewer -> 403
+- [ ] share invalid role -> 400
+- [ ] share with unknown username -> 404
+- [ ] share on non-existent resource -> 404
+- [ ] folder share grants access to documents inside (propagation)
+- [ ] nested folder share propagates to deeply nested documents
+- [ ] most permissive wins: direct viewer + folder editor => editor effective
+- [ ] owner of ancestor folder has owner over nested document
+
+## Activity Log
+- [ ] GET /activity -> 200 array; requires auth
+- [ ] entries record {action, userId, resourceType, resourceId, timestamp}
+- [ ] doc create/update/delete + share events logged
+
+## Validation
+- [ ] npm run build clean
+- [ ] npm run lint clean
+- [ ] npm test passes
